{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.mkModel\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkModel</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> (<a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Rat/Basic.html#Rat\">Rat</a>))</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Construct a model that satisfies all constraints in the cutsat model.\nIt also assigns values to integer terms that have not been internalized by the\ncutsat model.\n\nRemark: it uses rational numbers because cutsat may have failed to build an\ninteger model.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.mkModel","kind":"def","line":71,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.mkModel","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.lean#L71-L102"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.getAssignment?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">getAssignment?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Rat/Basic.html#Rat\">Rat</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.getAssignment?","kind":"def","line":60,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.getAssignment?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.lean#L60-L69"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.embeddingArg?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">embeddingArg?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `e` is a single embedding step — an accessor application (`Fin.val a`, `BitVec.toNat a`,\n`BitVec.toInt a`) or a conversion to `BitVec` (`a.toBitVec`) — returns `a`. The value of `e`\ndetermines the value of `a`. Unlike `isEmbeddingApp?`, chains such as `a.toBitVec.toNat` are\nnot collapsed; callers resolve them one step at a time.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.embeddingArg?","kind":"def","line":30,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.embeddingArg?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Model.lean#L30-L51"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Types","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.ModelUtil"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.Model"}